  "content": "\n\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093738/description_77757efe-9f1f-48e2-bc78-bb1131b6ae59.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"518\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">Chuck E Cheese: Back To The Bots</span>&nbsp;— это&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(незавершённый)</span> мод, который впервые на Java принесёт мир Chuck E Cheese в Minecraft! <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Management Wanted</a></strong></em></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"> &nbsp;</span></a></span>требуется</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">В </span></strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>этом моде вы найдёте</strong>:</span></em></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;Все аниматроники CeC 🐁&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;Множество артов CeC 🖼️</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;Аркадные игры 🎮</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;Декор сцены ⭐</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;Вывески Cec&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;Костюмы персонажей🐭</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Теперь пришло время построить свой собственный Chuck E Cheese в Minecraft!</p>\n<p>Этот мод является частью <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"https://discord.gg/89A65h9c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Homemade Studio</strong></em></a></span> (Discord), вот все наши остальные моды:</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-buddys-project-management-wanted-editon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">-The Buddy's Project 🐰🍦</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-craften-files/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&showAlphaFiles=show\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">-The Craften Files 🐰🍔</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-craften-files/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&showAlphaFiles=show\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093738/description_c1b7f9d6-2d92-4c89-959f-b526ca04da91.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"408\"></span></a></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Моделирование</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>LeBl&eacute;dard</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Mimz II</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Real Chuck E Cheese&nbsp;</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>The Error</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>KittyCandles</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Текстурирование&nbsp;</u></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>LeBl&eacute;dard</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Mimz II</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Abobus</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>The Error</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>KittyCandles</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Анимации</u></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>LeBl&eacute;dard&nbsp;</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Noish</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Abobus</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Программирование</u></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>LeBl&eacute;dard&nbsp;</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>ThatUgahnith65&nbsp;</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Бета-тестирование</u></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Paloonie</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Mimz II</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>ThatUgahnith65</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><u>Рендеры</u></span></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Noish</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Логотипы</u></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>Portal2half</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><u>LeBl&eacute;dard&nbsp;</u></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
